<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Three money center banks upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Three money center banks upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman analyst Raphael Soifer said he raised his short-term ratings on Citicorp, Chase Manhattan Corp and BankAmerica Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Cited favorable fundamental outlooks for all three over the near-term and said action was also based on firm's reaffirmation of bullish near-term overall outlook for stocks and bonds.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
